  "keys.error.failed": "The request failed (HTTP {status}).",
  "keys.unavailableHtml": "Keys can be entered here only where the dashboard's CLI assistant is enabled (on 127.0.0.1, or on a network address started with <code>smith ui --network-terminal</code>), in a browser that opened the login URL the server printed. In a terminal run <code>smith keys set asta</code> or <code>smith keys set openalex</code>. Request an Asta key at <a href=\"https://share.hsforms.com/1L4hUh20oT3mu8iXJQMV77w3ioxm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ai2</a>, an OpenAlex key at <a href=\"https://openalex.org/settings/api-key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openalex.org/settings/api-key</a>.",
