  "keys.outsideText": "Agents started from this dashboard receive the stored key. For one started elsewhere, export it from the file:",
  "keys.prompt.asta": "No Asta key yet: with one, the SOTA scout searches Ai2's Asta (Semantic Scholar corpus) first, and resolution fills abstracts OpenAlex lacks.",
  "keys.prompt.openalex": "No OpenAlex key saved: a free key gives about 10x the keyless daily budget.",
  "keys.prompt.open": "Add it in Doctor → API keys",
  "keys.prompt.dismiss": "Dismiss",
  "refs.note.plausibilityHtml": "<strong>How the reference search works:</strong> the SOTA scout discovers candidates through Ai2's Asta (the Semantic Scholar corpus) when an Asta key is set, and through the keyless web otherwise. Every accepted reference is then verified and stored by <code>smith paper resolve</code>, which asks Asta first and falls back to OpenAlex (the keyless default), Crossref and arXiv. Configure Asta once in <em>Doctor → API keys</em> or with <code>smith keys set asta</code> — request a key at <a href=\"https://share.hsforms.com/1L4hUh20oT3mu8iXJQMV77w3ioxm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ai2's Asta request form</a>; an optional free OpenAlex key at <a href=\"https://openalex.org/settings/api-key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openalex.org/settings/api-key</a> raises the daily budget about 10×.",
  "refs.note.writingHtml": "Every claim's source is verified by <code>smith paper resolve --resolver auto</code>: Asta first (with its key), then the keyless OpenAlex, Crossref and arXiv. Set the Asta key once in <em>Doctor → API keys</em> — <a href=\"https://share.hsforms.com/1L4hUh20oT3mu8iXJQMV77w3ioxm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">request it at Ai2</a>.",
